---
title: "The gate of one Game, written from the docs only"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Idle
    lg1: Busy
    lg2: Autoplay
    lg3: Breaks R10_ARunEndsOnAFailureOfItsOwnJobOnly in some cases
    lg4: Path to the R10_ARunEndsOnAFailureOfItsOwnJobOnly bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Idle
  s1: A Job holds the Game
  s2: A Job holds the Game, narrating
  s3: Idle with a failure line
  s4: A run holds the Game between Jobs
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you send an Action
  s1 --> s1: the Job saves its Input
  s1 --> s2: the Job starts its next step
  s2 --> s2: the narrator call of the Job fails or the Job saves a failure line
  s2 --> s3: the engine restarts
  s3 --> s4: you start Autoplay
  s4 --> s3: the run ends
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 mayBreak
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 purple
  class s4 bugPath
